OL,6,CG1990FBreakfast News presenter
OL,7,FNicholas Witchell is due to leave TV
OL,8,FCentre when news comes through that
OL,9,FPrime Minister Margaret Thatcher has
OL,10,Fresigned. Witchell reads a newsflash
OL,11,Fthen presents regular updates on BBC
OL,12,FOne from 10am until 4pm.
